Class demo::Person
{
  firstName: String[1];
  lastName: String[1];
}

###Relational
Database demo::DB
(
  Table PERSON (ID INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, FIRST_NAME VARCHAR(100), LAST_NAME VARCHAR(100))
)

###Mapping
Mapping demo::M
(
  demo::Person: Relational {
    ~mainTable [demo::DB] PERSON
    firstName: [demo::DB] PERSON.FIRST_NAME,
    lastName: [demo::DB] PERSON.LAST_NAME
  }
)

###Connection
RelationalDatabaseConnection demo::Conn
{
  store: demo::DB;
  type: H2;
  specification: LocalH2 { };
  auth: DefaultH2;
}

###Runtime
Runtime demo::RT
{
  mappings: [ demo::M ];
  connections: [ demo::DB: [ env: demo::Conn ] ];
}
